11887034,2025-02-01,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Old information reappears or never goes away,"I am filing a formal complaint against Experian and Equifax for ongoing credit reporting violations, inaccurate credit reporting, and failure to properly address identity fraud concerns. I have been subjected to repeated errors on my credit report, which have significantly impacted my credit score and financial well-being. I am also aware of the existing lawsuits against Experian and Equifax, and I have received official correspondence indicating that I am part of those legal actions.

