12019229,2025-02-10,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Old information reappears or never goes away,"Subject : Formal Demand for Immediate Removal of Fraudulent Reporting by XXXX XXXX XXXXXX/XX/XXXX XXXX XXXX Due to Identity Theft To Whom It May Concern, I am writing to formally dispute and demand the immediate removal of the fraudulent mortgage account being reported by XXXX XXXX XXXXXX/XX/XXXXXXXX XXXX on my credit report. I am a victim of identity theft, and this entity is illegally claiming to be my mortgage servicer and debt collector despite my having no contractual relationship with them. 
