4. Corporate and Equitable Estoppel ( UCC1, UCC1ad, UCC5 Filings ) I have filed UCC1 Financing Statements and UCC1Ad Amendments to protect my financial identity from fraudulent claims. Under UCC5 filings, any unauthorized attempt to collect a non-existent debt subjects TransUnion to corporate and equitable estoppel, legally barring further reporting of this invalid information.

