12070477,2025-02-13,Student loan,Private student loan,Dealing with your lender or servicer,Received bad information about your loan,"Subject : Complaint Against Navient for Violating Holder Rules and Refusal to Refund Post-Bankruptcy Collections Dear Consumer Financial Protection Bureau, I am writing to file a formal complaint against Navient for violating the Holder Rule and refusing to refund monies collected on private student loans post-bankruptcy. I am a member of the XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, where the Department of Education determined the school was guilty of misconduct. 

