Cease Communication Request : I appreciate your acknowledgment of my request to cease all communications regarding the PRA account. Be reminded that under the FDCPA Section 805 ( c ), debt collectors must cease communication upon written request, except to advise that the collector 's further efforts are being terminated, or to notify the consumer that the debt collector or creditor may invoke specified remedies.

