XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, GA XXXX XXXX ( XXXX ) XXXX XX/XX/XXXX Equifax Information Services LLC XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, GA XXXX **Re : Demand for Immediate Correction of Personal Information on Consumer Report** To Whom It May Concern : This letter serves as a formal demand for Equifax to immediately correct and update my personal information on my consumer report. Currently, the report contains multiple entries for my name, address, and employer, which are outdated, inaccurate, and misleading. These discrepancies are not only confusing but also constitute a violation of your statutory obligations under the **Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) **. 
